  displayName: Nymph
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a61bb419ad57b3c4685503acb9195c6a, type: 3}
  description: Nymphs are medium-sized fae, human-like in form and height, graceful
    and unsettlingly beautiful. They move at a calm pace that feels more like drifting
    than walking. They speak with soft, mesmerizing speech, often coaxing, bargaining,
    or luring with carefully chosen words.
